<title>CANADA: Trizec, Horsham boards OK merger.</title>
<headline>Trizec, Horsham boards OK merger.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1996-09-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Horsham Corp and Trizec Corp Ltd said in a joint statement on Friday that the boards of both companies had approved a merger proposed on September 10.</p>
<p>The merged real estate company will be called Trizec Hahn Corp. Under the merger, Trizec shareholders will get 0.58 Trizec Hahn share for each Trizec share.</p>
<p>The deal is expected to close in early November, subject to shareholder, regulatory and court approvals.</p>
<p>Horsham owns 48 percent of Trizec's common shares.</p>
<p>-- Reuters Toronto Bureau 416 941-8100</p>
</text>
